          type: "exact",
          answer: String(x),
          hint1: `Regroupe les $x$ à gauche : $${a}x - ${c}x = ${a - c}x$, et les nombres à droite : $${d} ${this.formatSigned(-b)} = ${d - b}$.`,
          solution: `$$${a}x - ${c}x = ${d} ${this.formatSigned(-b)}$$\n$$${a - c}x = ${d - b}$$\n$$x = \\frac{${d - b}}{${a - c}} = ${x}$$`
