          solution: `Développement pas à pas :\n$$E = (${a}x) \\times (${c}x) + (${a}x) \\times (${d}) + (${b}) \\times (${c}x) + (${b}) \\times (${d})$$\n$$E = ${coeffX2}x^2 + (${a * d})x + (${b * c})x + (${constTerm})$$\n$$E = ${this.formatPoly([coeffX2, coeffX, constTerm])}$$`
