        solution: `Le nombre de boules perdantes est $${nTotal} - ${nFav} = ${nContraire}$.\n$$P(\\bar{A}) = 1 - \\frac{${nFav}}{${nTotal}} = \\frac{${nContraire}}{${nTotal}} = ${this.formatFraction(nContraire, nTotal)}$$`
